## Original Content
Bruno Cardoso Reis diz que entrega de mísseis Patriot à Ucrânia é sinal positivo para as defesas ucranianas. Admite ainda que secretismo sobre o que cedeu o sistema é forma de confundir a Rússia.

## Summary
Bruno Cardoso Reis states that the delivery of Patriot missiles to Ukraine is a positive signal for Ukrainian defenses. He notes that secrecy about the specifics of the system's provision is a strategy to confuse Russia.

## Key Points
- The delivery of Patriot missiles to Ukraine is seen as a key positive development for the country's air defenses.
- The exact details of what was provided within the Patriot system are being kept secret.
- This secrecy is a deliberate tactic to create confusion for Russia.


